### Product Catalog REST API - runnable requests
### IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client or VS Code "REST Client": click "Send Request" above each block.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@api = {{base}}/api/v1/products

### List (JSON, default)
GET {{api}}?size=5

### Same list as plain text / XML / HTML (content negotiation)
GET {{api}}?size=5
Accept: text/plain

###
GET {{api}}?size=5
Accept: application/xml

###
GET {{api}}?size=5&format=html

### Search: Electronics 1000-9000, in stock, most expensive first, 3 per page (see Link header)
GET {{api}}?category=electronics&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=9000&inStock=true&sort=price,desc&size=3&page=0

### Keyword search
GET {{api}}?q=bottle&sort=name

### Create (JSON) -> 201 + Location + ETag
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "FIT-KBEL-01",
  "name": "Kettlebell 8 kg",
  "description": "Cast iron kettlebell",
  "category": "Fitness",
  "price": 1899.00,
  "stock": 25
}

### Create (XML)
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<product>
  <sku>FIT-KBEL-02</sku>
  <name>Kettlebell 12 kg</name>
  <category>Fitness</category>
  <price>2499.00</price>
  <stock>10</stock>
</product>

### Read one (copy the ETag from the response for the next requests)
GET {{api}}/1

### Conditional GET -> 304 when unchanged (paste the ETag)
GET {{api}}/1
If-None-Match: "paste-etag-here"

### Replace (PUT)
PUT {{api}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "ELEC-MOUSE-01",
  "name": "Wireless Mouse (Silent)",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 899.00,
  "stock": 100
}

### Partial update (PATCH, merge patch) with optimistic locking
PATCH {{api}}/1
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json
If-Match: "paste-etag-here"

{ "stock": 80 }

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{api}}/2

### Errors: validation (400), unknown id (404), bad Accept (406)
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "x", "name": "", "price": -1, "stock": -5 }

###
GET {{api}}/99999
Accept: application/xml

###
GET {{api}}
Accept: image/png

### OpenAPI document
GET {{base}}/openapi.json
